@vec256
process vector_fma_bench⦅int64 ptr_a ⸴ int64 ptr_b ⸴ int64 ptr_c ⸴ int64 n_bytes⦆ → int64 ⟦
    int64 off ↦ 0 ·
    cycle off ≺ n_bytes ⟦
        int64 pa ↦ ptr_a ⊕ off ·
        int64 pb ↦ ptr_b ⊕ off ·
        int64 pc ↦ ptr_c ⊕ off ·
        vec4f64 va ↦ vec4_load⦅pa⦆ ·
        vec4f64 vb ↦ vec4_load⦅pb⦆ ·
        vec4f64 vc ↦ vec4_fma⦅va ⸴ vb ⸴ va⦆ ·
        vec4_store⦅pc ⸴ vc⦆ ·
        off ← off ⊕ 32 ·
    ⟧
    yield 0 ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    int64 n_bytes ↦ 8000000 ·
    int64 ptr_a ↦ qadav_alloc⦅n_bytes⦆ ·
    int64 ptr_b ↦ qadav_alloc⦅n_bytes⦆ ·
    int64 ptr_c ↦ qadav_alloc⦅n_bytes⦆ ·

    int64 res ↦ vector_fma_bench⦅ptr_a ⸴ ptr_b ⸴ ptr_c ⸴ n_bytes⦆ ·

    vec4f64 v0 ↦ vec4_load⦅ptr_c⦆ ·
    vec4f64 v1 ↦ vec4_load⦅ptr_a⦆ ·
    vec4f64 v_add ↦ vec4_add⦅v0 ⸴ v1⦆ ·
    vec4f64 v_sub ↦ vec4_sub⦅v_add ⸴ v1⦆ ·
    vec4f64 v_mul ↦ vec4_mul⦅v_sub ⸴ v1⦆ ·
    vec4_store⦅ptr_c ⸴ v_mul⦆ ·

    emit "AVX2_SIMD_VERIFIED" ·

    qadav_free⦅ptr_a⦆ ·
    qadav_free⦅ptr_b⦆ ·
    qadav_free⦅ptr_c⦆ ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
